<BaseLayout
  title="Language Models Need Sleep: Memory Consolidation & Dreaming for LLMs | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="Inspired by human sleep, the Sleep paradigm lets LLMs consolidate short-term in-context knowledge into stable long-term parameters via upward distillation and RL-driven dreaming — beating SFT and GRPO on AIME while achieving near-perfect BABILong recall at 10M tokens."
