    <div class="canvas-controls">
      <button id="dream-play">▶ Play</button>
      <button id="dream-reset">↺ Reset</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="math-block">
<div class="math-label">Dream Selection &amp; Reward</div>
Dreams = &#123;DREAM(1), ..., DREAM(m)&#125; ~ LM_θ(·|C, random_expert)
<br><br>
<span class="math-comment">// Importance score = gradient of SFT loss w.r.t. model params</span>
<span class="math-var">g_DR(i)</span> = ∇_θ L_SFT(DREAM(i), θ)
<br><br>
Select Top-k by importance + b random (for diversity)
<br><br>
<span class="math-comment">// Reward = performance improvement after fine-tuning on dream</span>
<span class="math-var">r_DREAM</span> = 1 if fine-tuned model improves on task τ, else 0
</div>
</section>

